  259|       |      ** setup mm:  [...][CAT stack ...] [cont|?]  [mo|tmtype] [o1]  [o2]
  260|       |      ** in asm:    [...][CAT stack ...] [cont|PC] [mo|delta]  [o1]  [o2]
  261|       |      **            ^-- func base                              ^-- mm base
  262|       |      ** after mm:  [...][CAT stack ...] <--push-- [result]
  263|       |      ** next step: [...][CAT stack .............]
